Naesip
$cards
DECK 1 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
IQI 10 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IQI 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IQI 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IQI 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IQI 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
IQI 0 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE IQI IQI
DEST Rank 1
MOVE_STACK IQI IQI
SRC Rank K
$win
OR
    PILE ALL IQI Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL IQI Empty
        PILE ALL IQI Empty
